<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Seimitsu to buy back Y3 bln worth of shares.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Seimitsu to buy back Y3 bln worth of shares.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tokyo Seimitsu Co Ltd said on Wednesday it plans to buy back three billion yen worth of its shares or one million shares in total.</p>
<p>The Japanese maker of semiconductor-manufacturing systems said in a statement that the company's board had decided on the share buy-back plan.</p>
